{"seq":11,"trial_id":"m2-pilot-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-mu-dev/si-02-tansleigh-ticket/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-23T00:56:29.871Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f14b090981d77b4361eb25eb9af48f48acad3dd394b7420d3d49e6c7051a7472","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"Pree, it's ticket **#88412**.\n\nTobias posted it in #central-team on 2 July 2025. It was the Tier 2 support escalation for the Door 6 gatehouse tablet freezing on the BOL barcode scan at **Tansleigh Packaging**. The night shift lead said the scanner app hung whenever a Quarendon Freightways driver arrived with a split manifest.\n\nThat's the only source I found. I couldn't see any ticket records in the files you have access to, so I haven't checked the number against the support system itself. Tobias first wrote \"TP\", and that day's thread sorted out that he meant Tansleigh Packaging, not Tansley Parcel. #88412 is the packaging ticket, so make sure the deck doesn't tie it to the parcel account."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
